  "description": "Internal alterations to Units 1 and 2 to reconfigure the ground floor office layout, including the formation of new WC facilities and relocation of access to the existing toilets so they are accessed from the warehouse area rather than the offices. The works also include alterations to the existing mezzanine floor, including reducing the mezzanine space,  installing structural reinforcement to accommodate a new open plan office area, while retaining the existing staircase access. Externally, the proposal includes the installation of nine new powder-coated aluminium framed double-glazed windows, comprising seven windows to the front elevation and two windows to the right-hand elevation. There is no change to the overall use of the building.",
